This directory contains tests related to the various extensions to the
co-expression facilities.  These include MultiProgram (synchronous,
dynamically loaded) and Threads (true concurrent, based on pthreads).

To look for data races, build with ThreadSanitizer and run the tests
with the suppressions in tsan.supp (see the Threads job in
.github/workflows/build.yml, which does this one test at a time):

   ./configure --enable-tsan --enable-debug && make
   cd tests/thread
   TSAN_OPTIONS="suppressions=$PWD/tsan.supp report_thread_leaks=0" make Test

stress.icn races on shared globals on purpose and always reports.
